    "claim": "App discovery and activation: an app is any runtime/<name>/app.properties; activation is membership in the comma-separated `apps` key of config.properties, written by app/settings (which re-runs init_globals — no restart to activate a facet-served app). app.properties' `libraries=` list drives load_library at init. The peer-to-peer alternative to git import is dev/install_lib, which streams the library zip from a peer and copies data/<lib>/_APPS/<app> out to runtime/<app>.",
