    "claim": "The plugin pass is an api.js mechanic: installControl checks the registry after every control activates — selector entries install at el.querySelector(selector) scoped to the host element; selectorless entries attach a hidden headless div to the host. No control embeds a dev:plugins div; dev.plugins is just the registry home (list_plugins).",
    "detail": "Registry fetched once per page, single-flight, err -> empty (anonymous pages simply have no plugins). Plugins get their own pass (grafts on grafts); nesting capped at 4 data-nb-plugin ancestors against cyclic registries. Selector scoping changed from document-global to host-element — entries must target selectors inside their target control. Entries apply on the next page load, same as ever.",
    "tags": "bench-collapse",
